+   entry .frenchWeekdays   od `lundi` do `dimanche`
+   entry .germanWeekdays   od `Montag` do `Sonntag`
+   entry .spanishWeekdays   od `lunes` do `domingo`

@ 0 1 0 073f0832e56a35591f6088ee56ccef18
